  "bodyHash": "sYw7ASH8/T8=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYeecoyN/images/a31abac5b6635e78e3b92cd0c7b4964a2151a2e5.png\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p><p><strong>透過這款全面翻新的使用者介面，讓你更貼近實現田園風格的夢想！</strong></p><p>源自於對<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/overgrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁花蔓延介面</a>續作的構想，額外繁花介面已成為一款附加元件，為那些希望在喜愛的介面上增添現代感、更多藤蔓與花卉的玩家而設計！</p><p>許多畫面現在將佈滿花朵與藤蔓，誰會不喜歡這樣呢？<br>此版本還重塑了多個使用者介面，賦予其更簡潔現代的視覺美感，並在開啟物品欄時提供更清晰的視野！<br>其中一項重大變更是移除了容器標籤文字，畢竟我想你應該早就知道自己正在使用工作台了。</p><p>本專案仍處於早期開發階段，目前僅修改了少數容器，請務必同時安裝原始的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/overgrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁花蔓延介面</a>以獲得完整效果，但記得將此資源包置於清單頂端！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYeecoyN/images/dd0eef031f2d976e48fed776c6a4168e62c82fcc.png\" alt=\"展示額外繁花介面應載入於繁花蔓延介面之上的圖片\">查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgsli.com%252fMzAyNTIx%252f0%252f1\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>滑動展示頁面，與原始風格及原版風格進行比較！</strong></a></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UYeecoyN/images/f2d4eaf06036b01308f1f262876bd8b679edce4e.png\" alt=\"物品欄展示\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">喜歡這個新外觀嗎？歡迎在我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/Se9TVRXF\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord伺服器</a>發表意見，或於您選擇的平台留言，您的回饋將影響此附加元件的開發方向。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252fua1AmdlB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://svgur.com/i/1B8Z.svg\" alt=\"繁花蔓延介面合集\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我們\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IUJGdLaw/images/252a451536a1b077ccb7e3dc8671c333fd911f47.png\" alt=\"快捷欄分隔線\"></p>",
